1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,065
Geometrical optics says the image of a slit is a sharp bright rectangle.

2
00:00:05,065 --> 00:00:11,705
What you actually see is this: a broad central band, flanked by fainter and fainter bands.

3
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:15,013
Every optical image is really a diffraction pattern.

4
00:00:15,013 --> 00:00:17,604
A point is never imaged as a point.

